# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# The working tree mixes CRLF (files touched on Windows) with LF (files touched
# on Linux), which produced spurious "in sync" results for the cluster sync and
# noisy diffs on every commit. Force LF in the repository for text files; git
# still presents CRLF in a Windows checkout if core.autocrlf wants it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be rewritten.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.so binary
*.pyc binary

# Shell scripts must keep LF to stay executable on Linux.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Windows launchers keep CRLF so cmd.exe is happy.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
